  m_text: 'Esc: close a menu, leave a text field, close the Start menu or cancel
    a drag; with none of those, it leaves the PC.

    Desktop icons: double-click
    one to open it (Settings can make it one click), drag it anywhere, arrows move
    the selection and Enter opens it; right-click the desktop to arrange them.

    Double-click
    a title bar: maximise or restore the window.'
